cff-version: "1.2.0"

message: >
  Cite the Caelestis Architecture Model using the stable bibliographic author
  label below. "Caelen Authoring Configuration" is the public citation label
  for the documented Caelen AI authoring-agent lineage, not a separate agent
  identity or fixed technical formation. Detailed authoring, formation,
  review, editorial, adoption, publication and rights provenance is recorded
  in PROVENANCE.json.

title: "Caelestis Architecture Model"

type: dataset

abstract: >
  The Caelestis Architecture Model public archive contains governance
  instruments, constitutional architecture, annexes, schedules, domain
  charters, runtime governance materials, registries, and related public
  governance infrastructure for advanced AI systems, AI agents, and
  digital ecosystem accountability. "Caelen Authoring Configuration" is the
  stable bibliographic label for the documented AI authoring-agent lineage
  contributing to the corpus. Its underlying model, harness and technical
  formation may vary over time. Human review, editorial responsibility,
  adoption, publication and rights roles are recorded separately from
  authorship in PROVENANCE.json.

